Let me try adding `"types": ["node"]` to tsconfig. Also maybe the issue is `skipLibCheck` or `lib`. Let me test a minimal compile.

Actually, maybe TypeScript 7 changed the default `types` resolution and it no longer auto-includes @types without explicit `types`. Let me add `"types": ["node"]`.

